  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nBased on [unstable version of API docs](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/unstable.html#post-matrix-client-r0-publicrooms), I see another JSON property (`new_rooms`) in response of `publicRooms` when paginating through rooms. where is the doc for it?\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  /*OtherProps*/\r\n  \"new_rooms\": false\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI started paginating through public rooms and that property was false, then created a new public room,  kept the same pagination going on to the next batch and property remains false.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- https://matrix.org/_matrix/client/r0/publicRooms?access_token=TOKEN\r\n- _POST_ request body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n\t\"limit\": 1,\r\n\t\"since\": \"next_batchTOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nHS: Matrix.org",
